## FEATURE 1 — COMMITMENT INTELLIGENCE

Create an intelligent AI meeting analysis engine.

Users must be able to:

- Paste meeting transcripts.
- Upload TXT and PDF meeting notes.
- View meeting history.
- Analyze meetings using AI.
